# No e2e test of its own yet: give it a row of its tests when it has some.
/src/(.*/)?bug(\.rs|/)                                                       ^bug_
/src/(.*/)?(atlas|city|city_colours|city_filter|city_gpu|city_labels|city_shell|glance|scene)(\.rs|/)                    city|home|status_bar
/src/(.*/)?(notice|notices|toast|float_panel|give_back)(\.rs|/)              notice|undo|toast
/src/(.*/)?(confirm|quit)(\.rs|/)                                            quit|cmd_q|asks_first|closing
/src/(.*/)?(sneak|sneak_place|sneak_apps)(\.rs|/)                            sneak
/src/(.*/)?marks(\.rs|/)                                                     mark
/src/(.*/)?projects(\.rs|/)                                                  projects_section|a_project_dragged
